      "speaker_hint": "player",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Thanks for the info, I appreciate it.",
      "JA_current": "良いことを聞いた。感謝するよ。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_fox_hello_dialog_3111#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "21111",
      "text_id": "escape_fox_hello_dialog_21111",
      "next": [
        "1"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "2111"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "That's all you wanna know? Take a week off and then come back to see me. Look, my time ain't cheap and I'm kinda busy right now. Here are the basics and then you're on your own. About three kilometers North of here, you'll find the Garbage. That's the place where they used to dump all the radioactive waste from the station. High radiation levels, anomalies all over the place, so there are loads of artifacts to be found there... but not very valuable. Just beware of the gangs and don't cross the Duty patrols. West of the Garbage is the former Agroprom Research Institute. Little in terms of artifacts there so you can skip it. And to the East, there's the Dark Valley. Who knows... That's a pretty weird place. It seems quiet enough, apart from a bunch of gangsters roaming around. But I got a feeling there's more to it than meets the eye. Oh, and there's the Rostok factory right beyond the Garbage. That's Duty territory and a popular stalker hideout. You'll find lots of clued-up folks there, they'll tell you the rest.",
      "JA_current": "それが知りたいだけか？ 1週間後に会いに戻って来てくれ。いいか、俺の時間は安くはない、それにちょっと今は忙しい。ここを基点に、アンタ一人で行くんだ。ここから3キロ北の辺りで、Garbage を見つけるだろう。そこはあらゆる放射性廃棄物を駅からどっさり捨てるのに使われた場所だ。放射能濃度が高く、いたる所にアノーマリーが存在し沢山のアーティファクトを見つけられる… だが、あまり貴重なものはない。ギャングに注意しろ、それに Duty のパトロールは横切るな。Garbage の西は、旧 Agroprom 研究所だ。アーティファクトはほとんど無いから、そこはスッ飛ばしてもかまわない。そして東側に、Dark Valley がある。よくは知らんがね… そこはかなり怪しい場所だ。辺りをうろついている多くのギャングは別として、ずいぶんと静かな場所に見える。だが目に映る多くのものがそこにある感じがするな。ああ、それに Rostok の工場が、Garbage を越えてすぐにある。そこはストーカーの支配地域だ。そこでもっと知っている連中を見つけられると思う、彼らが残りを話してくれるだろう。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_fox_hello_dialog_21111#1"
      ]
    },
